  "title": "Kinetik Reports Record First Quarter 2026 Financial Results",
  "summary": "Kinetik Holdings Inc. (NYSE: KNTK) (“ Kinetik ” or the “ Company ”) today reported financial results for the quarter ended March 31, 2026. For the three months ended March 31, 2026, Kinetik reported net loss including noncontrolling interest of $5.1 million, Adjusted EBITDA 1 of $251.2 million, Distributable Cash Flow 1 of $180.8 million, and Free Cash Flow 1 of $101.4 million. Highlights Delivered record first quarter 2026 financial results, driven by strong execution across the Company Amended",
